---
import VerifyForm from '../components/VerifyForm';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="description" content="Proof Existence: crea y verifica pruebas de existencia para documentos en Hive." />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<title>Proof Existence · Evidencia que permanece</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<header class="mx-auto flex h-16 w-full max-w-7xl items-center justify-between border-b border-ocean/10 bg-white px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-10"><a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-bold tracking-tight text-ink"><span class="grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-ocean text-white"><span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full border-2 border-gold"></span></span> Proof Existence</a><nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-ink-muted"><a href="/crear" class="rounded-lg px-3 py-2 transition hover:bg-aqua-50 hover:text-ink">Crear prueba</a><a href="#verificar" class="hidden rounded-lg px-3 py-2 transition hover:bg-aqua-50 hover:text-ink sm:block">Verificar TXID</a><a href="/crear" class="ml-2 inline-flex min-h-10 items-center justify-center border border-ocean/25 px-4 text-sm font-bold text-ocean transition hover:bg-ocean hover:text-white focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-4 focus-visible:ring-ocean/20">Comenzar <span class="ml-2">→</span></a></nav></header>
		<main>
			<section class="border-b border-ocean/10 bg-white"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="flex items-center px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 sm:py-24 lg:px-16 lg:py-32"><div class="max-w-xl"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-ink-muted"><span class="grid h-7 w-7 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-aqua-100 text-ocean">✓</span> Evidencia digital en Hive</div><h1 class="mt-7 text-5xl font-semibold leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.07em] text-ink sm:text-6xl">Lo que existió,<br /><span class="text-ocean">puede probarse.</span></h1><p class="mt-6 max-w-lg text-base leading-7 text-ink-muted sm:text-lg">Ancla la huella de un documento en una blockchain pública sin entregar el archivo. Una capa de certeza para contratos, escritos y evidencias.</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3"><a href="/crear" class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center bg-ocean px-5 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-[0_8px_20px_rgba(53,95,104,0.14)] transition hover:bg-ocean-dark focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-4 focus-visible:ring-ocean/25">Crear una prueba <span class="ml-2">→</span></a><span class="text-sm text-ink-muted">Procesamiento local</span></div></div></div><div class="paper-grid flex min-h-[24rem] items-center justify-center border-l border-ocean/10 bg-[#f8fbfb] px-6 py-16 sm:px-12 lg:min-h-[34rem] lg:px-16"><div class="w-full max-w-md border border-ocean/15 bg-white p-5 shadow-[0_12px_32px_rgba(36,66,74,0.06)]"><div class="flex items-start justify-between border-b border-ocean/10 pb-4"><div><p class="text-[0.65rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-muted">Proof record</p><p class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Documento acreditado</p></div><div class="grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-full border border-ocean/20 text-ocean">⌁</div></div><div class="space-y-3 py-5"><div class="h-2 w-2/5 bg-ocean/20"></div><div class="h-2 w-full bg-ocean/10"></div><div class="h-2 w-5/6 bg-ocean/10"></div><div class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-[0.32fr_1fr] gap-2 border border-ocean/10 p-3"><div class="h-20 border-r border-ocean/10"></div><div class="space-y-3 pl-2"><div class="h-2 w-4/5 bg-ocean/15"></div><div class="h-2 w-full bg-ocean/10"></div><div class="h-2 w-3/5 bg-gold/55"></div></div></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between border-t border-ocean/10 pt-4"><span class="font-mono text-[0.65rem] text-ink-muted">SHA-256 · proof_ext</span><span class="text-xs font-semibold text-mint">Verificable</span></div></div></div></div></section>

			<section id="verificar" class="border-b border-ocean/10 bg-white px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 sm:py-24 lg:px-10"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl"><VerifyForm client:load /></div></section>
			<section class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-8 px-5 py-16 sm:grid-cols-3 sm:px-8 sm:py-24 lg:px-10"><div><p class="eyebrow text-ocean">Por qué importa</p><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.05em] text-ink">Una evidencia que se puede volver a mirar.</h2></div><div class="border-t border-ocean/15 pt-5"><p class="text-sm font-bold text-ocean">01 · Integridad</p><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-muted">El hash cambia si cambia el archivo. La prueba conserva una referencia exacta.</p></div><div class="border-t border-ocean/15 pt-5"><p class="text-sm font-bold text-ocean">02 · Transparencia</p><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-muted">Cualquiera puede consultar la transacción y comprobar el registro público.</p></div></section>
		</main>
		<footer class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col gap-3 border-t border-ocean/10 px-5 py-8 text-xs text-ink-muted sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:px-8 lg:px-10"><span>Proof Existence · versión experimental</span><span>La blockchain prueba existencia e integridad; no sustituye asesoría legal.</span></footer>
	</body>
</html>
